review_comment:
An alternative to blanket disabling of all verification is middleground where you opt-out of strict x509 checks in the SSLContext
```
@dataclasses.dataclass(frozen=True, kw_only=True)
class _RelaxedX509ConnectionInfo(ConnectionInfo):
    def as_ssl_context(self) -> ssl.SSLContext:
        ctx = super().as_ssl_context()
        ctx.verify_flags &= ~ssl.VERIFY_X509_STRICT
        return ctx
```

