review_comment:
Flow run state change events have information about the initial state in the payload, which could be useful here.

Here's an example:
```
"payload": {
    "intended": {
      "to": "RUNNING",
      "from": "PENDING"
    },
    "initial_state": {
      "name": "Pending",
      "type": "PENDING"
    },
    "validated_state": {
      "name": "Running",
      "type": "RUNNING"
    }
  },
```

I know that'll only work when in event subscription mode and not polling mode, but it would provide a more explicit check, so it might be worth exploring.

